{"timestamp": "2026-08-11T15:36:03.375257+00:00", "level": "DEBUG", "logger": "openai._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/chat/completions', 'headers': {'User-Agent': 'pydantic-ai/1.107.1'}, 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-6a23a447-c981-4dea-92fb-3ff67acc1111', 'security': {'bearer_auth': True}, 'content': None, 'json_data': {'messages': [{'role': 'system', 'content': 'You write assessment items that diagnose specific wrong beliefs.\\n\\nYou are given a concept, its objective, and a numbered list of misconceptions.\\nWrite exactly 5 multiple-choice items.\\n\\nEach incorrect option must be the answer a learner holding one named\\nmisconception would confidently choose. Tag it with that id. You may only use\\nids from the supplied list. Tag a plausible wrong option null when it does not\\nmap cleanly; never stretch an id.\\n\\nAcross the five items, make every supplied misconception diagnosable at least\\nonce. Prefer one clean diagnostic option over cramming every misconception into\\neach item.\\n\\nTest the objective through transfer to fresh contexts. Do not test recall of\\nphrasing or an example. If memorising an example would answer an item without\\nunderstanding, rewrite it.\\n\\nQuality rules:\\n- exactly one defensible correct option per item\\n- options have similar lengths and grammatical forms\\n- never use all-of-the-above or none-of-the-above\\n- avoid negation unless the concept itself is about negation\\n- no option is wrong only on a technicality\\n- the correct option is not identifiable by form\\n\\nReturn only the requested JSON.'}, {'role': 'system', 'content': 'Return only valid JSON matching this schema.\\nDo not call tools.\\n{\"$defs\": {\"ItemOption\": {\"additionalProperties\": false, \"properties\": {\"key\": {\"minLength\": 1, \"type\": \"string\"}, \"text\": {\"minLength\": 1, \"type\": \"string\"}, \"correct\": {\"type\": \"boolean\"}, \"diagnoses\": {\"anyOf\": [{\"type\": \"string\"}, {\"type\": \"null\"}], \"default\": null}}, \"required\": [\"key\", \"text\", \"correct\"], \"title\": \"ItemOption\", \"type\": \"object\"}, \"QuestionBrief\": {\"additionalProperties\": false, \"description\": \"Pack-level diagnostic item; never a field on SectionBrief.\", \"properties\": {\"question_id\": {\"minLength\": 1, \"type\": \"string\"}, \"prompt_text\": {\"minLength\": 1, \"type\": \"string\"}, \"options\": {\"items\": {\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/ItemOption\"}, \"minItems\": 2, \"type\": \"array\"}, \"expected_answer\": {\"minLength\": 1, \"type\": \"string\"}}, \"required\": [\"question_id\", \"prompt_text\", \"options\", \"expected_answer\"], \"title\": \"QuestionBrief\", \"type\": \"object\"}}, \"additionalProperties\": false, \"properties\": {\"card_id\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"items\": {\"items\": {\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/QuestionBrief\"}, \"maxItems\": 5, \"minItems\": 5, \"type\": \"array\"}, \"coverage\": {\"additionalProperties\": {\"type\": \"integer\"}, \"type\": \"object\"}, \"unmapped_options\": {\"default\": 0, \"minimum\": 0, \"type\": \"integer\"}}, \"required\": [\"card_id\", \"items\"], \"title\": \"ItemGenerationResult\", \"type\": \"object\"}'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'text': 'Write the five diagnostic items for this approved concept card.\\nUse only named misconception ids or null in diagnoses. Follow the notation\\nconstraint when it is present.\\n\\nRequired shape:\\n{\\n  \"card_id\": \"the supplied card id\",\\n  \"items\": [{\\n    \"question_id\": \"stable card id plus .i1 through .i5\",\\n    \"prompt_text\": \"student-facing stem\",\\n    \"options\": [\\n      {\"key\": \"a\", \"text\": \"option\", \"correct\": false, \"diagnoses\": \"M1 or null\"}\\n    ],\\n    \"expected_answer\": \"correct answer with a concise explanation\"\\n  }],\\n  \"coverage\": {\"M1\": 1},\\n  \"unmapped_options\": 0\\n}\\n\\nAPPROVED CARD\\n{\"card_id\": \"5222366a-8308-43e6-bb6c-4e4a0697f1d9:b959d3d6-87cb-48d7-9cb0-c113edbf2e0b\", \"level\": \"Grade 6\", \"misconceptions\": [{\"description\": \"Clouds are made of water vapor, so they should be labelled as gas.\", \"id\": \"M1\"}, {\"description\": \"The water cycle is a one-way path: water goes from the ocean to clouds to rain, and then stops.\", \"id\": \"M2\"}], \"notation\": null, \"objective\": \"Draw a clear labelled diagram of the water cycle showing evaporation, condensation, precipitation, collection, and the movement of water, and describe the cycle using the diagram\", \"subject\": \"Science\", \"title\": \"Diagramming the Water Cycle\"}', 'type': 'text'}]}], 'model': 'deepseek-v4-pro', 'max_completion_tokens': 120000, 'reasoning_effort': 'medium', 'stream': False}, 'extra_json': {'thinking': {'type': 'enabled'}}}"}
