r. What process turns liquid water into water vapor? Draw an arrow from the ocean upward and label it.\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\"answer\\\\\": \\\\\"Label \\'evaporation\\' and draw an upward arrow from ocean to cloud.\\\\\"\\\\n    },\\\\n    {\\\\n      \\\\\"explanation\\\\\": \\\\\"Water vapor rises and cools. What forms in the sky? Remember, water vapor is invisible; clouds are tiny liquid droplets. Draw arrows showing water vapor condensing into clouds.\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\"answer\\\\\": \\\\\"Label \\'condensation\\' near the cloud, draw arrows curling into cloud.\\\\\"\\\\n    },\\\\n    {\\\\n      \\\\\"explanation\\\\\": \\\\\"When cloud droplets get heavy, what happens? Draw arrows showing water falling from the cloud.\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\"answer\\\\\": \\\\\"Label \\'precipitation\\', draw downward arrows from cloud to ground.\\\\\"\\\\n    },\\\\n    {\\\\n      \\\\\"explanation\\\\\": \\\\\"Where does the water go after it falls? It collects in oceans, lakes, or puddles. Draw arrows showing water returning to the ocean.\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\"answer\\\\\": \\\\\"Label \\'collection\\', draw arrow along ground to ocean.\\\\\"\\\\n    }\\\\n  ],\\\\n  \\\\\"answer\\\\\": \\\\\"The completed diagram shows the sun shining on the ocean, an upward arrow labelled \\'evaporation\\' leading to clouds, curves labelled \\'condensation\\' into clouds, a downward arrow \\'precipitation\\', and a ground-level arrow \\'collection\\' back to the ocean, forming a cycle.\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\"check\\\\\": \\\\\"Check that your arrows form a continuous loop: ocean \\\\u2192 evaporation \\\\u2192 condensation \\\\u2192 precipitation \\\\u2192 collection \\\\u2192 ocean.\\\\\"\\\\n}\",\\n  \"requested_object\": \"worked-example\",\\n  \"validation_errors\": [\\n    {\\n      \"message\": \"Field required\",\\n      \"path\": \"steps.0.text\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \"message\": \"Extra inputs are not permitted\",\\n      \"path\": \"steps.0.explanation\"\\n    },\\n    {\